"**not** affect the ``/quota`` L2 eviction loop (see ``--eviction-check-"
"interval`` below)."
msgstr "过期的 MP 服务器注册之间进行健康检查的秒数。``0`` 禁用过期实例逐出循环；这不会影响 ``/quota`` L2 逐出循环（见下面的 ``--eviction-check-interval``）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:61
msgid "``--eviction-check-interval``"
msgstr "``--eviction-check-interval``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:62
