msgstr "``5``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:63
msgid "Seconds between L2 eviction sweeps. ``0`` disables the loop."
msgstr "L2 逐出清扫之间的秒数。\\ ``0`` 禁用循环。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:64
msgid "``--eviction-ratio``"
msgstr "``--eviction-ratio``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:65
msgid "``0.2``"
msgstr "``0.2``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:66
msgid "Fraction of tracked keys (by count) to evict per cycle (0.0 to 1.0)."
msgstr "每个周期逐出的跟踪键的比例（按计数，范围为 0.0 到 1.0）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:67
msgid "``--trigger-watermark``"
msgstr "``--trigger-watermark``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:68
msgid "``1.0``"
msgstr "``1.0``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:69
msgid ""
"Eviction fires when usage reaches this fraction of the quota (0.0 "
"exclusive to 1.0)."
msgstr "当使用量达到配额的该比例时触发逐出（取值范围为 (0.0, 1.0]，不含 0.0）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:71
msgid "``--chunk-size``"
msgstr "``--chunk-size``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:72
msgid "``256``"
msgstr "``256``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:73
msgid ""
"Tokens per KV chunk: the CacheBlend match unit and the unit used to "
"resolve pin ``token_ids`` to keys. Must equal the MP servers' ``--chunk-"
"size``."
msgstr ""
"每个 KV 块的令牌数：CacheBlend 匹配单元和用于将固定的 ``token_ids`` 解析为键的单元。必须等于 MP 服务器的 "
"``--chunk-size``。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:76
msgid "``--hash-algorithm``"
msgstr "``--hash-algorithm``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:77
msgid "``blake3``"
msgstr "``blake3``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:78
msgid ""
"Token hash algorithm for pin key resolution. Must equal the MP servers' "
"``--hash-algorithm``. ``blake3`` is self-contained; other algorithms "
"require vLLM importable in the coordinator process."
msgstr ""
"用于 pin 密钥解析的令牌哈希算法。必须与 MP 服务器的 ``--hash-algorithm`` 相等。``blake3`` "
"是自包含的；其他算法需要在协调器进程中可导入的 vLLM。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:81
msgid "``--enable-blend-lookup``"
msgstr "``--enable-blend-lookup``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:82 ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:121
msgid "off"
msgstr "关"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:83
msgid ""
"Index stored chunk content so ``POST /directory/blend-lookup`` can serve "
"fleet CacheBlend reuse. Off by default: hashing content costs CPU on "
"every store. Also requires the MP servers' ``--coordinator-event-"
"reporting``."
msgstr "索引存储的块内容，以便 ``POST /directory/blend-lookup`` 可以服务于舰队的 CacheBlend 重用。默认情况下关闭：哈希内容会在每次存储时消耗 CPU。还需要 MP 服务器的 ``--coordinator-event-reporting``。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:87
msgid "``--blend-probe-stride``"
msgstr "``--blend-probe-stride``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:88
msgid "``1``"
msgstr "``1``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:89
msgid ""
"Positions between CacheBlend match probes. ``1`` probes every offset for "
"full recall. Ignored unless blend lookup is on."
msgstr "在 CacheBlend 匹配探测之间的位置。``1`` 在每个偏移量上进行探测以实现完全回忆。除非启用混合查找，否则将被忽略。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:91
msgid "``--checkpoint-path``"
msgstr "``--checkpoint-path``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:92 ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:101
#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:105 ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:137
msgid "(empty)"
msgstr "（空）"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:93
msgid ""
"File the coordinator's derived state is checkpointed to. Empty disables "
"it and the coordinator starts cold after every restart."
msgstr "协调器的派生状态被检查点保存到的文件。为空则禁用该功能，协调器在每次重启后将冷启动。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:95
msgid "``--checkpoint-interval``"
msgstr "``--checkpoint-interval``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:96
msgid "``60``"
msgstr "``60``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:97
msgid ""
"Seconds between checkpoint writes; ``0`` writes only on a clean stop. "
"Ignored without a path. Does not affect the metadata file, which is "
"written whenever pins or quotas change."
msgstr "检查点写入之间的秒数；``0`` 仅在干净停止时写入。没有路径时被忽略。不会影响元数据文件，该文件在引脚或配额更改时写入。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:100
msgid "``--metadata-path``"
msgstr "``--metadata-path``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:102
msgid ""
"File the operator-set state (L2 pins and per-``cache_salt`` quotas) is "
"stored in. Empty means that state is lost on restart."
msgstr "操作员集状态（L2 引脚和每个 ``cache_salt`` 配额）存储的文件。为空意味着在重启时状态会丢失。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:104
msgid "``--extra-config``"
msgstr "``--extra-config``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:106
msgid ""
"JSON object of settings the core flags do not name, read by whichever "
"view or controller looks for them. Two keys are read by the coordinator "
"itself: ``controller_packages``, a list of importable paths to load out-"
"of-tree controllers from, and ``disabled_controllers``, a list of class "
"names to leave unbuilt -- which is how one of those takes a built-in "
"controller's place instead of running beside it."
msgstr "核心标志未命名的设置的 JSON 对象，由查找它们的视图或控制器读取。协调器本身读取两个键：``controller_packages``，一个可导入路径的列表，用于加载树外控制器，以及 ``disabled_controllers``，一个要保留未构建的类名列表——这就是其中一个如何替代内置控制器而不是与其并行运行的方式。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:113
msgid "``--timeout-keep-alive``"
msgstr "``--timeout-keep-alive``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:115
msgid ""
"Seconds the HTTP server keeps idle connections open before closing them. "
"Must be greater than the MP servers' heartbeat interval (default ``5``), "
"otherwise heartbeat requests may hit a closing connection and fail with "
"``Server disconnected without sending a response``."
msgstr ""
"HTTP 服务器在关闭空闲连接之前保持打开的秒数。必须大于 MP 服务器的心跳间隔（默认 "
"``5``），否则心跳请求可能会遇到关闭的连接并失败，出现 ``服务器在未发送响应的情况下断开连接``。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:120
msgid "``--disable-metrics``"
msgstr "``--disable-metrics``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:122
msgid ""
"Skip OpenTelemetry metrics initialization. Metrics are on by default; "
"pass this flag and the local ``/metrics`` endpoint returns 404."
msgstr "跳过 OpenTelemetry 指标初始化。默认情况下启用指标；传递此标志后，本地 ``/metrics`` 端点将返回 404。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:124
msgid "``--otlp-endpoint``"
msgstr "``--otlp-endpoint``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:125
msgid "unset"
msgstr "未设置"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:126
msgid ""
"OTLP gRPC endpoint for metrics push mode. When unset, Prometheus pull "
"mode exposes ``/metrics`` on the coordinator HTTP port. When set, the "
"local ``/metrics`` endpoint returns 404."
msgstr "OTLP gRPC 端点用于指标推送模式。当未设置时，Prometheus 拉取模式在协调器 HTTP 端口上暴露 ``/metrics``。当设置时，本地 ``/metrics`` 端点返回 404。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:129
msgid "``--event-transport``"
msgstr "``--event-transport``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:130
msgid "``http``"
msgstr "``http``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:131
msgid ""
"Transport the fleet's cache events arrive on, exactly one. ``http`` "
"serves ``POST /events``; ``kafka`` consumes ``--kafka-topic`` instead "
"(one ``CacheEventsRequest`` JSON envelope per record, the same body "
"``POST /events`` accepts) and ``POST /events`` answers 404. ``kafka`` "
"needs the ``lmcache[kafka]`` extra (``pip install 'lmcache[kafka]'``)."
msgstr "传输舰队的缓存事件到达的方式，恰好一个。 ``http`` 服务于 ``POST /events``； ``kafka`` 则消费 ``--kafka-topic``（每条记录一个 ``CacheEventsRequest`` JSON 信封，与 ``POST /events`` 接受的相同主体），并且 ``POST /events`` 返回 404。 ``kafka`` 需要额外的 ``lmcache[kafka]``（``pip install 'lmcache[kafka]'``）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:136
msgid "``--kafka-bootstrap-servers``"
msgstr "``--kafka-bootstrap-servers``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:138
msgid ""
"Comma-separated Kafka bootstrap servers. Required with ``--event-"
"transport kafka``."
msgstr "以逗号分隔的 Kafka 启动服务器。与 ``--event-transport kafka`` 一起使用是必需的。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:140
msgid "``--kafka-topic``"
msgstr "``--kafka-topic``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:141
msgid "``lmcache-cache-events``"
msgstr "``lmcache-cache-events``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:142
msgid ""
"Topic to consume; must match the MP servers' ``--coordinator-kafka-"
"topic``. Ignored unless ``--event-transport kafka``."
msgstr "消费的主题；必须与 MP 服务器的 ``--coordinator-kafka-topic`` 匹配。除非 ``--event-transport kafka``，否则将被忽略。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:145
msgid "``--kafka-group-id``"
msgstr "``--kafka-group-id``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:146
msgid "``lmcache-coordinator``"
msgstr "``lmcache-coordinator``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:147
msgid ""
"Consumer group whose committed offsets a restart resumes from. A new "
"group reads the whole retained stream. Ignored unless ``--event-transport"
" kafka``."
msgstr "消费者组，其已提交的偏移量将在重启时恢复。新组将读取整个保留的流。除非 ``--event-transport kafka`` 被指定，否则将被忽略。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:152
msgid "Loading your own controllers"
msgstr "加载您自己的控制器"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:154
msgid ""
"A **controller** gives the coordinator behaviour of its own — fleet-wide "
"L2 eviction is one, warm-prefetch dispatch is another. Add yours by "
"putting it in any importable package and naming that package in "
"``--extra-config``. The package imports from lmcache; nothing in lmcache "
"imports it."
msgstr "一个 **控制器** 赋予协调器自己的行为——全局 L2 逐出是一个，温暖预取调度是另一个。通过将其放入任何可导入的包中并在 ``--extra-config`` 中命名该包来添加您的控制器。该包从 lmcache 导入；lmcache 中没有任何内容导入它。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:201
msgid "``run`` is an async context manager and must do three things, in order:"
msgstr "``run`` 是一个异步上下文管理器，必须按顺序执行三件事："

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:203
msgid "**Start** the background work."
msgstr "**开始**后台工作。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:204
msgid ""
"``yield`` **exactly once** — the coordinator serves for the duration of "
"that yield."
msgstr "``yield`` **恰好一次** — 协调器在该 yield 的持续时间内提供服务。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:206
msgid ""
"**Stop** the work in a ``finally``, so teardown runs whether shutdown was"
" clean or an exception unwound the stack."
msgstr "**停止** 在 ``finally`` 中的工作，以便无论关闭是否干净，清理都能运行。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:209
msgid "The same JSON names the package and carries the controller's own settings:"
msgstr "相同的 JSON 指定了包并携带控制器的自身设置："

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:221
msgid ""
"Every hook is optional: write only ``run``, only ``get_routers``, or add "
"``consume`` to receive the cache-event stream and "
"``get_durable_components`` to have your state checkpointed. Name a "
"package — scanned entire, so a controller that outgrows one file can be a"
" directory — or a single module. A name that does not import raises at "
"startup; a controller that raises while starting is logged and skipped. "
"Views cannot be added this way: they are the coordinator's own shared "
"state, which your controller reads."
msgstr "每个钩子都是可选的：只需编写 ``run``、只需编写 ``get_routers``，或者添加 ``consume`` 以接收缓存事件流，并添加 ``get_durable_components`` 以保存状态检查点。命名一个包——可以扫描整个包，因此一个超出单个文件的控制器可以是一个目录——或一个单独的模块。一个未导入的名称在启动时会引发错误；在启动时引发错误的控制器会被记录并跳过。视图不能以这种方式添加：它们是协调器自己共享的状态，您的控制器可以读取。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:229
msgid ""
"**Disabling a built-in controller.** Name its class in "
"``disabled_controllers`` and it is not built, taking its endpoints with "
"it — which is how a controller of your own replaces one rather than "
"running beside it:"
msgstr "**禁用内置控制器。** 在 ``disabled_controllers`` 中命名其类，则该控制器不会被构建，其端点也随之消失——这就是您自己的控制器如何替代一个控制器而不是与之并行运行的方式："

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:241
msgid "A name matching no discovered controller raises at startup."
msgstr "在启动时，如果没有发现匹配的控制器名称，将会引发错误。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:244
msgid "Coordinator metrics export"
msgstr "协调器指标导出"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:246
msgid ""
"Metrics are enabled by default. Without an OTLP endpoint, Prometheus "
"scrapes the coordinator's existing FastAPI port; no separate metrics "
"server or port is created:"
msgstr "默认情况下启用指标。没有 OTLP 端点时，Prometheus 会抓取协调器现有的 FastAPI 端口；不会创建单独的指标服务器或端口："

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:254
msgid ""
"Set ``--otlp-endpoint http://collector:4317`` to push metrics to an "
"OpenTelemetry Collector instead. In OTLP push mode, and when ``--disable-"
"metrics`` is set, ``GET /metrics`` returns 404. The Coordinator exports "
"Key Directory placement-count and reported-logical-byte gauges for the "
"``l1`` and ``l2`` tiers. See :doc:`observability/metrics` for their exact"
" names and semantics."
msgstr "设置 ``--otlp-endpoint http://collector:4317`` 以将指标推送到 OpenTelemetry Collector。在 OTLP 推送模式下，当设置了 ``--disable-metrics`` 时，``GET /metrics`` 返回 404。协调器导出 ``l1`` 和 ``l2`` 层的 Key Directory placement-count 和 reported-logical-byte 指标。有关它们的确切名称和语义，请参见 :doc:`observability/metrics`。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:262
msgid "Connecting MP servers"
msgstr "连接 MP 服务器"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:264
msgid ""
"An MP server (``lmcache server``) joins the coordinator when you point it"
" at one with ``--coordinator-url``. It registers on startup, heartbeats "
"while running, and deregisters on shutdown -- all on the server's own "
"event loop. This is opt-in: with no URL set, the server runs exactly as "
"before. Each flag falls back to a matching ``LMCACHE_COORDINATOR_*`` "
"environment variable (handy for the Kubernetes downward API); an explicit"
" flag wins over the env var."
msgstr ""
"当您通过 ``--coordinator-url`` 为 MP 服务器（\\ ``lmcache server``\\ "
"）指定协调器地址时，该服务器便会加入协调器。它在启动时注册、运行时持续发送心跳、关闭时注销——所有操作均在服务器自身的事件循环中完成。此功能为可选项：若未设置"
" URL，服务器的行为与之前完全相同。每个标志均可回退到对应的 ``LMCACHE_COORDINATOR_*`` 环境变量（在使用 "
"Kubernetes Downward API 时非常便捷）；显式标志优先于环境变量。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:275
msgid "Flag (on the MP server)"
msgstr "标志（在 MP 服务器上）"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:276
msgid "Env fallback"
msgstr "环境回退"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:278
msgid "``--coordinator-url``"
msgstr "``--coordinator-url``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:279
msgid "``LMCACHE_COORDINATOR_URL``"
msgstr "``LMCACHE_COORDINATOR_URL``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:280
msgid ""
"Coordinator base URL, e.g. ``http://coordinator:9300``. Enables "
"registration when set."
msgstr "协调器基础 URL，例如 ``http://coordinator:9300``\\ 。设置后启用注册。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:282
msgid "``--coordinator-advertise-ip``"
msgstr "``--coordinator-advertise-ip``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:283
msgid "``LMCACHE_COORDINATOR_ADVERTISE_IP``"
msgstr "``LMCACHE_COORDINATOR_ADVERTISE_IP``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:284
msgid ""
"IP the coordinator should reach this server at (defaults to the server's "
"outbound IP)."
msgstr "协调器应通过此服务器访问的 IP（默认为服务器的外部 IP）。"

