msgstr "``LMCACHE_COORDINATOR_EVENT_REPORTING``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:292
msgid ""
"Stream cache store/access/delete events to the coordinator, feeding the "
"key directory (fleet-wide placement tracking) and, for L2 events, "
"usage/quota tracking and eviction."
msgstr "将缓存存储/访问/删除事件流式传输到协调器，提供键目录（全队列放置跟踪）以及对于 L2 事件的使用/配额跟踪和逐出。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:295
