msgstr "``LMCACHE_COORDINATOR_EVENT_FLUSH_INTERVAL``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:297
msgid ""
"Seconds between cache-event batch flushes (must be ``> 0``, default "
"``1``)."
msgstr "缓存事件批量刷新之间的秒数（必须为 ``> 0``，默认值为 ``1``）。"

