msgid "(none)"
msgstr "（无）"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:301
msgid "Event delivery transport: ``http`` (default) or ``kafka``."
msgstr "事件传递传输：``http``（默认）或``kafka``。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:302
msgid "``--coordinator-kafka-bootstrap-servers``"
msgstr "``--coordinator-kafka-bootstrap-servers``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:304
msgid ""
"Comma-separated Kafka bootstrap servers. Required for the ``kafka`` event"
" transport."
msgstr "以逗号分隔的 Kafka 启动服务器。``kafka`` 事件传输所必需。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:306
msgid "``--coordinator-kafka-topic``"
msgstr "``--coordinator-kafka-topic``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:308
msgid "Kafka event topic (default ``lmcache-cache-events``)."
msgstr "Kafka 事件主题（默认 ``lmcache-cache-events``）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:309
msgid "``--coordinator-kafka-delivery-timeout``"
msgstr "``--coordinator-kafka-delivery-timeout``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:311
msgid "Seconds to wait for Kafka broker acknowledgement (default ``10``)."
msgstr "等待 Kafka 代理确认的秒数（默认 ``10``）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:313
msgid ""
"With the Kafka transport, start the coordinator with ``--event-transport "
"kafka`` and the same topic so it consumes the stream instead of serving "
"``POST /events``; without that, the broker retains the records but "
"nothing reads them. Both sides need the optional ``lmcache[kafka]`` extra"
" (``pip install 'lmcache[kafka]'``), imported only when Kafka is "
"selected. A restarted coordinator resumes from its consumer group's "
"committed offsets; coordinator-driven replay of a detected gap is a "
"follow-up."
msgstr "使用 Kafka 传输时，使用 ``--event-transport kafka`` 启动协调器，并使用相同的主题，以便它消费流而不是提供 ``POST /events``；否则，代理会保留记录但没有任何读取它们。双方都需要可选的 ``lmcache[kafka]`` 附加组件（``pip install 'lmcache[kafka]'``），仅在选择 Kafka 时导入。重新启动的协调器从其消费者组的已提交偏移量恢复；协调器驱动的检测到的间隙重放是后续操作。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:322
msgid ""
"The server registers under its stable identity (``--instance-id`` / OTel "
"``service.instance.id``); if the flag is not passed, the server mints a "
"random UUID v4 at startup and registers under that."
msgstr ""
"服务器在其稳定身份下注册（\\ ``--instance-id`` / OTel ``service.instance.id``\\ "
"）；如果未传递该标志，服务器将在启动时生成一个随机的 UUID v4 并在该 UUID 下注册。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:326
msgid ""
"Registration is best-effort: if the coordinator is unreachable, the MP "
"server logs a warning, keeps retrying, and continues serving. A malformed"
" heartbeat-interval value is rejected at startup."
msgstr "注册是尽力而为的：如果协调器无法访问，MP 服务器会记录警告，持续重试，并继续提供服务。启动时会拒绝格式错误的心跳间隔值。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:331
msgid "HTTP endpoints"
msgstr "HTTP 端点"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:333
msgid ""
"The coordinator's HTTP surface (base URL ``http://localhost:9300``) "
"groups into:"
msgstr "协调器的 HTTP 接口（基础 URL ``http://localhost:9300``）分为："

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:335
msgid ""
"**Fleet membership and health** -- registration and liveness "
"(``/instances``, ``/healthz``)."
msgstr "**车队成员资格和健康** -- 注册和存活 (``/instances``, ``/healthz``)。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:337
msgid ""
"**Quota, usage, and eviction** -- the ``/quota`` group: per-tenant byte "
"budgets, usage accounting, and the usage-event ingest that drives fleet-"
"wide eviction."
msgstr "**配额、使用情况和逐出** -- ``/quota`` 组：每个租户的字节预算、使用情况核算，以及驱动全队逐出的使用事件摄取。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:340
msgid ""
"**Cache control** -- the ``/cache`` group: cache operations dispatched to"
" a named server (warm prefetch, pin/unpin, and delete, with more to "
"come)."
msgstr "**缓存控制** -- ``/cache`` 组：分派给命名服务器的缓存操作（热预取、固定/解固定和删除，更多功能即将推出）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:342
msgid ""
"**Fleet memory** -- the ``/instances/usage`` endpoints: how full each "
"server's memory compartments are, joining event-derived usage against the"
" capacity each server declares on the same event stream. Read-only."
msgstr "**舰队内存** -- ``/instances/usage`` 端点：每个服务器的内存区块的使用情况，结合事件派生的使用量与每个服务器在同一事件流中声明的容量。只读。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:345
msgid ""
"**CacheBlend fragment lookup** -- ``POST /directory/blend-lookup``: finds"
" cached chunk content anywhere inside a query sequence, using the blend "
"index derived from the key directory's token bindings. Server-to-"
"coordinator only; not usually called by hand."
msgstr "**CacheBlend 片段查找** -- ``POST /directory/blend-lookup``：在查询序列中查找任何地方的缓存块内容，使用从密钥目录的令牌绑定派生的混合索引。仅限服务器到协调器；通常不手动调用。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:350
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Each endpoint is documented below. Success is ``200`` unless noted, and "
"``{cache_salt}`` uses the ``_default`` sentinel for the empty salt. The "
"wire types live in ``lmcache/v1/mp_coordinator/schemas.py``."
msgstr ""
"每个端点的文档如下。成功状态为 ``200``，除非另有说明，``{cache_salt}`` 使用 ``_default`` "
"哨兵表示空盐。数据类型位于 ``lmcache/v1/mp_coordinator/schemas.py``。"

