#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:542
msgid "Quota, usage, and eviction"
msgstr "配额、使用情况和逐出"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:544
msgid ""
"The ``/quota`` group owns per-``cache_salt`` byte budgets, the live usage"
" accounting behind them, and the usage-event stream that drives fleet-"
"wide eviction. (The MP server exposes a node-local ``/quota`` with the "
"same shape; this is its fleet-wide counterpart.) Use ``_default`` as the "
"path parameter to target the empty-string salt."
msgstr ""
"``/quota`` 组拥有每个 ``cache_salt`` 字节预算、其背后的实时使用情况核算，以及驱动全队逐出的使用事件流。 （MP "
"服务器暴露了一个节点本地的 ``/quota``，形状相同；这是其全队对应的版本。）使用 ``_default`` 作为路径参数以针对空字符串盐。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:552
msgid ""
"Do **not** use the MP server's node-local ``/quota`` API together with "
"the coordinator's. The two are independent, unsynchronized quota "
"registries enforcing eviction on the **same shared L2**: the server-side "
"enforcer (active when the server runs a per-salt eviction policy) uses "
"strict allowlist semantics — any salt missing from *its own* table is "
"fully evicted — and it never sees quotas registered on the coordinator, "
"and vice versa. Mixing the two produces competing eviction decisions: the"
" server can wipe data the coordinator considers within quota (or still "
"exempt before the default limit is armed). Pick one owner per deployment "
"— in coordinator-managed deployments, register quotas **only** through "
"the coordinator's ``/quota`` API and leave the servers' node-local quota "
"tables untouched."
msgstr ""
"请勿将 MP 服务器的节点本地 ``/quota`` API 与协调器的 API 一起使用。这两者是独立的、不同步的配额注册表，在 **同一共享 "
"L2** 上强制执行逐出：服务器端的强制执行者（在服务器运行每个盐的逐出策略时处于活动状态）使用严格的白名单语义——任何缺失于 *其自身* "
"表中的盐都会被完全逐出——并且它永远无法看到在协调器上注册的配额，反之亦然。混合这两者会产生相互竞争的逐出决策：服务器可以删除协调器认为在配额内的数据（或在默认限制生效之前仍然豁免的数据）。每个部署选择一个所有者——在协调器管理的部署中，仅通过协调器的"
" ``/quota`` API 注册配额，并保持服务器的节点本地配额表不变。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:565
msgid ""
"Salts without an explicit quota are governed by the registry's **default "
"limit** (``PUT /quota/config``). On boot the default is unset, and "
"unquota'd salts are **exempt** from eviction — quotas live in memory, so "
"a freshly (re)started coordinator has an empty quota table until the "
"external quota controller re-syncs it, and the exempt default keeps that "
"window from mass-evicting unknown tenants. After re-registering every "
"per-salt quota, the controller sets the default to ``0`` — the signal "
"that arms strict allowlist enforcement (all bytes under unquota'd salts "
"become evictable on the next cycle):"
msgstr ""
"没有显式配额的盐由注册表的 **默认限制** (``PUT /quota/config``) 管控。启动时默认值未设置，未配额的盐 **免于** "
"逐出 — "
"配额存储在内存中，因此一个新启动的（重新）协调器在外部配额控制器重新同步之前有一个空的配额表，而免配额的默认值防止在这一窗口内大规模逐出未知租户。在重新注册每个盐的配额后，控制器将默认值设置为"
" ``0`` — 这是启动严格允许列表强制执行的信号（所有未配额盐下的字节将在下一个周期变为可逐出）："

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:587
msgid ""
"When MP servers enable ``--coordinator-event-reporting``, they stream "
"cache ``store``, ``access``, and ``delete`` events to the coordinator's "
"``POST /events``. Applied ``l2`` batches also feed the quota side: the "
"coordinator aggregates per-``cache_salt`` usage, enforces quotas, and "
"selects LRU keys to evict. Each batch carries the server's "
"``instance_id``, ``incarnation``, and a monotonically increasing sequence"
" number (``seq``) scoped to that instance, so replays are deduplicated "
"and lost batches are detected."
msgstr "当 MP 服务器启用 ``--coordinator-event-reporting`` 时，它们将缓存 ``store``、``access`` 和 ``delete`` 事件流式传输到协调器的 ``POST /events``。应用的 ``l2`` 批次也会反馈到配额方面：协调器汇总每个 ``cache_salt`` 的使用情况，强制执行配额，并选择 LRU 键进行逐出。每个批次携带服务器的 ``instance_id``、``incarnation`` 和一个单调递增的序列号 (``seq``)，该序列号作用于该实例，因此重放是去重的，丢失的批次会被检测到。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:596
msgid ""
"**Active eviction loop.** Every ``--eviction-check-interval`` seconds, "
"the coordinator inspects per-salt usage against the registered quotas "
"and, for any salt over the trigger watermark, picks LRU victims and "
"dispatches a single ``DELETE /cache/objects`` to a uniformly random "
"registered MP server. Because all MP servers share the same backing L2 "
"(e.g. one S3 bucket), one dispatch evicts the keys for the whole fleet. "
"The MP server's L2 adapter fires ``on_l2_keys_deleted`` listeners after "
"the delete completes; those listeners ship ``delete`` events back through"
" ``POST /events``, which is what updates the coordinator's LRU + per-salt"
" totals. Dispatch failures or no-instances-registered fall through to the"
" next cycle — at-least-once semantics, safe because the S3 delete is "
"idempotent."
msgstr "**主动逐出循环。** 每隔 ``--eviction-check-interval`` 秒，协调器检查每个盐的使用情况与注册的配额，并对任何超过触发水位线的盐选择 LRU 牺牲品，并向一个均匀随机的注册 MP 服务器发送单个 ``DELETE /cache/objects`` 请求。由于所有 MP 服务器共享相同的后端 L2（例如，一个 S3 存储桶），一次调度会逐出整个集群的键。MP 服务器的 L2 适配器在删除完成后触发 ``on_l2_keys_deleted`` 监听器；这些监听器通过 ``POST /events`` 发送 ``delete`` 事件，这会更新协调器的 LRU + 每个盐的总数。调度失败或没有注册实例将进入下一个周期 — 至少一次语义，这是安全的，因为 S3 删除是幂等的。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:609
msgid ""
"**Cold start.** The coordinator's trackers are in-memory and are built "
"only from the cache-event stream, so after a restart per-salt usage "
"starts at zero even though the bytes are still resident in L2. Quotas "
"under-report until enough events accumulate. Unquota'd salts are exempt "
"from eviction until the quota controller sets a default limit, so a cold "
"coordinator cannot mass-evict — but it can under-evict, and an operator "
"re-arming quotas right after a restart should expect the usage numbers to"
" climb toward the true value rather than start at it."
msgstr "**冷启动。** 协调器的跟踪器是内存中的，仅从缓存事件流构建，因此在重启后，每个盐的使用情况从零开始，即使字节仍然驻留在 L2 中。配额在足够的事件积累之前会低报。未配额的盐在配额控制器设置默认限制之前免于逐出，因此冷启动的协调器无法进行大规模逐出——但它可以进行不足逐出，操作员在重启后重新设置配额时应预期使用数字会向真实值攀升，而不是从真实值开始。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:619
msgid "``PUT /quota/config`` / ``GET /quota/config``"
msgstr "``PUT /quota/config`` / ``GET /quota/config``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:621
msgid ""
"Set / read the default limit applied to salts with no explicit quota "
"entry."
msgstr "设置/读取未明确配额条目的盐的默认限制。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:623
msgid "**Request body** (``PUT``):"
msgstr "**请求体** (``PUT``):"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:632
msgid "``default_limit_gb``"
msgstr "``default_limit_gb``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:633
msgid "float or null"
msgstr "浮动或空值"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:634
msgid ""
"``null`` (the boot default) exempts unquota'd salts from eviction; ``0`` "
"arms strict allowlist enforcement (all unquota'd bytes become evictable "
"next cycle); a positive value grants every unquota'd salt that byte "
"budget."
msgstr ""
"``null``（启动默认值）使未配额的盐免于逐出；``0`` "
"启用严格的白名单执行（所有未配额的字节在下一个周期变为可逐出）；正值为每个未配额的盐提供该字节预算。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:638 ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:680
#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:837
msgid "``tier``"
msgstr "``tier``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:640
msgid "Optional (default ``l2``). Only ``l2`` is supported today."
msgstr "可选（默认 ``l2``）。目前仅支持 ``l2``。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:660
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``PUT /quota/{cache_salt}``"
msgstr "``PUT /quota/{cache_salt}``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:662
msgid "Create or update a tenant's byte budget."
msgstr "创建或更新租户的字节预算。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:664 ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:712
#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:743
msgid ""
"**Path parameters:** ``cache_salt`` — tenant identifier (``_default`` for"
" the empty salt)."
msgstr "**路径参数:** ``cache_salt`` — 租户标识符 (``_default`` 表示空盐)。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:676
msgid "``limit_gb``"
msgstr "``limit_gb``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:677
msgid "float"
msgstr "浮点数"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:678
msgid ""
"Byte budget in GiB; must be ``>= 0`` (``0`` clears the tenant's data on "
"the next eviction cycle)."
msgstr "以 GiB 为单位的字节预算；必须为 ``>= 0``（``0`` 会在下一个逐出周期清除租户的数据）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:682
msgid ""
"Optional (default ``l2``). Cache tier the quota applies to; only ``l2`` "
"is supported today."
msgstr "可选（默认 ``l2``）。配额适用的缓存层级；目前仅支持 ``l2``。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:693
msgid "``200``: quota applied."
msgstr "``200``: 已应用配额。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:694
msgid "``400``: invalid limit (negative or non-finite)."
msgstr "``400``: 无效的限制（负值或非有限值）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:695 ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1082
#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1210
msgid "``422``: request body fails field-level validation."
msgstr "``422``: 请求体未通过字段级验证。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:707
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``DELETE /quota/{cache_salt}``"
msgstr "``DELETE /quota/{cache_salt}``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:709
msgid ""
"Remove a salt's quota entry. Any bytes still cached under it become over-"
"budget on the next eviction cycle (effective limit drops to ``0``)."
msgstr "删除盐的配额条目。任何仍然缓存的字节将在下一个逐出周期变为超出预算（有效限制降至 ``0``）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:715
msgid ""
"**Query parameters:** ``tier`` — optional (default ``l2``); cache tier "
"the quota applies to."
msgstr "**查询参数:** ``tier`` — 可选（默认 ``l2``）；配额适用的缓存层级。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:724
msgid ""
"When no quota was registered for the salt, ``status`` is "
"``\"not_found\"`` (still ``200 OK``)."
msgstr "当未为盐注册配额时，``status`` 为 ``\"not_found\"``（仍然是 ``200 OK``）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:729
msgid "``200``: removed, or ``not_found`` if no quota existed."
msgstr "``200``: 已移除，或 ``not_found`` 如果不存在配额。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:739
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``GET /quota/{cache_salt}``"
msgstr "``GET /quota/{cache_salt}``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:741
msgid "Read the quota and live usage for a single salt."
msgstr "读取单个盐的配额和实时使用情况。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:746
msgid ""
"**Query parameters:** ``tier`` — ``l1`` or ``l2`` (default ``l2``). Every"
" field describes the requested tier. Quotas are enforced on L2 only, so "
"an ``l1`` read reports L1 usage with ``quota_exists: false`` and "
"``quota_limit_gb: 0.0`` -- never the L2 budget, which governs different "
"bytes."
msgstr "**查询参数:** ``tier`` — ``l1`` 或 ``l2``（默认 ``l2``）。每个字段描述请求的层级。配额仅在 L2 上强制执行，因此 ``l1`` 读取报告 L1 使用情况，``quota_exists: false`` 和 ``quota_limit_gb: 0.0`` — 永远不会报告 L2 预算，后者管理不同的字节。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:757
msgid ""
"``quota_limit_gb`` is the configured limit in GiB (``0.0`` when no quota "
"is set), ``quota_exists`` whether an explicit quota is registered, and "
"``usage_gb`` the current aggregate usage. This endpoint never returns "
"``404`` for an unknown salt."
msgstr ""
"``quota_limit_gb`` 是以 GiB 为单位的配置限制（当未设置配额时为 ``0.0``），``quota_exists`` "
"表示是否注册了显式配额，``usage_gb`` 是当前的总使用量。此端点对于未知的 salt 永远不会返回 ``404``。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:763
msgid "``200``: quota and usage reported."
msgstr "``200``: 报告配额和使用情况。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:773
msgid "``GET /quota``"
msgstr "``GET /quota``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:775
msgid "List total usage and a per-salt breakdown."
msgstr "列出总使用量和每个 salt 的详细信息。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:777
msgid ""
"**Query parameters:** ``tier`` — ``l1`` or ``l2`` (default ``l2``). Every"
" field describes the requested tier, and rows come from that tier's usage"
" plus the quotas that apply to it -- so an ``l1`` listing holds only "
"salts with L1 bytes, each with ``quota_exists: false``. ``all`` is "
"rejected with ``400``, because a key resident in both tiers holds bytes "
"in both and a cross-tier total would count it twice."
msgstr "**查询参数:** ``tier`` — ``l1`` 或 ``l2``（默认 ``l2``）。每个字段描述请求的层级，行来自该层级的使用量以及适用的配额——因此 ``l1`` 列表仅包含具有 L1 字节的 salts，每个都具有 ``quota_exists: false``。``all`` 被拒绝，返回 ``400``，因为一个同时存在于两个层级的键在两个层级中都占用字节，跨层级的总数会重复计算。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:795
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``total_gb`` is aggregate usage across all salts in GiB; each "
"``by_cache_salt`` entry has the same fields as the ``GET "
"/quota/{cache_salt}`` response."
msgstr ""
"``total_gb`` 是所有 salt 的总使用量（以 GiB 为单位）；每个 ``by_cache_salt`` 条目具有与 ``GET "
"/quota/{cache_salt}`` 响应相同的字段。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:800
msgid "``200``: usage reported."
msgstr "``200``: 报告的使用情况。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:809
msgid ""
"Usage events arrive on the fleet cache-event stream (``POST /events``); "
"there is no separate quota ingestion endpoint. See "
"``docs/design/v1/mp_coordinator/cache_events.md`` for the batch format "
"and routing semantics."
msgstr "使用事件通过舰队缓存事件流（``POST /events``）到达；没有单独的配额摄取端点。有关批处理格式和路由语义，请参见 ``docs/design/v1/mp_coordinator/cache_events.md``。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:815
msgid "Key directory"
msgstr "密钥目录"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:817
msgid ""
"The ``/directory`` group is a read-only operator view of the fleet-wide "
"key directory: which keys are cached, where (instance / tier / backend), "
"and what token ids each chunk holds. The directory is **eventually "
"consistent soft state** built from the servers' cache-event stream -- "
"every answer is a hint to be validated at the owning server, never a "
"guarantee."
msgstr "``/directory`` 组是整个集群密钥目录的只读操作员视图：哪些密钥被缓存，在哪里（实例 / 层 / 后端），以及每个块持有什么令牌 ID。该目录是 **最终一致的软状态**，由服务器的缓存事件流构建而成——每个答案都是一个提示，需在拥有服务器上进行验证，而不是保证。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:824
msgid "``GET /directory/keys``"
msgstr "``GET /directory/keys``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:826
msgid "List cached keys and their placements, one page at a time."
msgstr "列出缓存的键及其位置，一次一页。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:828
msgid "**Query parameters:**"
msgstr "**查询参数：**"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:834 ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1268
msgid "Parameter"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:838
msgid "``all``"
msgstr "``all``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:839
msgid "Keep placements on this tier (``l1`` / ``l2``; ``all`` keeps every tier)."
msgstr "在此层级保留放置（``l1`` / ``l2``；``all`` 保留所有层级）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:842 ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:846
msgid "*(empty)*"
msgstr "*(空)*"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:843
msgid "Keep placements reported by this MP server (empty keeps every instance)."
msgstr "保留此 MP 服务器报告的放置（空值保留每个实例）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:845
msgid "``backend``"
msgstr "``backend``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:847
msgid ""
"Keep placements on this backend, e.g. ``dram`` / ``fs`` (empty keeps "
"every backend)."
msgstr "在此后端上保留放置，例如 ``dram`` / ``fs``（空值保留每个后端）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:849 ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1277
msgid "``offset``"
msgstr "``offset``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:850
msgid "``0``"
msgstr "``0``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:851
msgid "Matching keys to skip (pagination)."
msgstr "跳过的匹配键（分页）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:852 ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1280
msgid "``limit``"
msgstr "``limit``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:853
msgid "``1000``"
msgstr "``1000``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:854
msgid "Maximum keys to return (1 to 10000)."
msgstr "返回的最大键数（1 到 10000）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:887
msgid ""
"``total`` counts every key with at least one placement matching the "
"filters; ``keys`` is the requested page of them, each with **only its "
"matching placements**. ``num_tokens`` reports how many token ids the "
"directory knows for the key's chunk (``0`` = unknown) -- fetch the actual"
" tokens via ``POST /directory/lookup``, which exists precisely so listing"
" pages stay small. ``access_count`` is the number of ``access`` events "
"applied to the key since the directory first saw it. Pages of a changing "
"directory may skip or repeat keys (snapshot semantics)."
msgstr "``total`` 计算每个至少有一个匹配过滤器的放置的键；``keys`` 是请求的页面，每个键仅包含 **其匹配的放置**。``num_tokens`` 报告目录知道的键块的令牌 ID 数量（``0`` = 未知）——通过 ``POST /directory/lookup`` 获取实际的令牌，该接口的存在正是为了保持列出页面的大小。``access_count`` 是自目录首次看到该键以来应用于该键的 ``access`` 事件的数量。变化的目录的页面可能会跳过或重复键（快照语义）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:898
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``200``: page returned (an empty directory returns ``{\"total\": 0, "
"\"keys\": []}``)."
msgstr "``200``: 页面返回（一个空目录返回 ``{\\\"total\\\": 0, \\\"keys\\\": []}``）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:899
msgid ""
"``422``: invalid parameter (negative ``offset``, ``limit`` out of range, "
"unknown ``tier``)."
msgstr "``422``: 无效参数（负数 ``offset``, ``limit`` 超出范围, 未知 ``tier``）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:910
msgid "``POST /directory/lookup``"
msgstr "``POST /directory/lookup``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:912
msgid ""
"Resolve cache content to its placements and token ids. One endpoint, two "
"forms -- supply exactly one:"
msgstr "将缓存内容解析为其位置和令牌 ID。一个端点，两种形式 -- 精确提供其中一种："

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:915
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**keys form** -- ``{\"keys\": [...]}``: resolve keys you already have "
"(e.g. from ``GET /directory/keys``)."
msgstr "**keys form** -- ``{\"keys\": [...]}``: 解析您已经拥有的键（例如来自 ``GET /directory/keys``）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:917
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**tokens form** -- ``{\"token_ids\": [...], \"model_name\": ..., "
"\"world_size\": ..., \"cache_salt\": ...}``: resolve a request's tokens "
"to the keys of its complete chunks (the same fan-out the pin APIs use)."
msgstr "**tokens form** -- ``{\"token_ids\": [...], \"model_name\": ..., \"world_size\": ..., \"cache_salt\": ...}``: 将请求的令牌解析为其完整块的键（与 pin API 使用的相同分发方式）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:923
msgid ""
"``token_ids`` must be the request's **whole** token sequence from "
"position 0, not one chunk's worth. Chunk hashes are prefix-chained -- "
"each chunk's key depends on every token before it -- so a mid-request "
"slice resolves to different (nonexistent) keys. Trailing tokens that do "
"not fill a chunk are ignored."
msgstr "``token_ids`` 必须是请求的 **完整** 令牌序列，从位置 0 开始，而不是一个块的内容。块哈希是前缀链式的——每个块的键依赖于它之前的每个令牌——因此请求中间的切片会解析为不同的（不存在的）键。未填满块的尾部令牌会被忽略。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:929
msgid "**Request body** (tokens form):"
msgstr "**请求体** (tokens 形式):"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:940
msgid "**Request body** (keys form):"
msgstr "**请求体** (键形式):"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:976
msgid ""
"``chunks`` is the number of complete chunks the tokens resolved to (keys "
"form: the number of keys requested); ``results`` has one entry per "
"resolved key, in request order (tokens form: ``chunks`` x the per-rank "
"fan-out). ``placements`` is empty for keys the directory does not know; "
"``token_ids`` is empty when the directory has no tokens for the key's "
"chunk (never stored with token reporting on, or not yet re-reported after"
" an event gap). ``access_count`` is the number of ``access`` events "
"applied to the key, ``0`` for unknown keys."
msgstr "``chunks`` 是令牌解析为的完整块的数量（键的形式：请求的键的数量）；``results`` 每个解析的键都有一个条目，按请求顺序排列（令牌的形式：``chunks`` x 每个排名的分支）。``placements`` 对于目录不知道的键是空的；当目录没有该键的块的令牌时，``token_ids`` 是空的（在令牌报告开启时从未存储，或在事件间隙后尚未重新报告）。``access_count`` 是应用于该键的 ``access`` 事件的数量，对于未知键为 ``0``。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:986
msgid "``200``: results returned."
msgstr "``200``: 返回的结果。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:987
msgid ""
"``400``: the token sequence exceeds the per-request cap, or a resolution "
"parameter is invalid (e.g. ``model_name`` contains ``@``)."
msgstr "``400``: 令牌序列超过每个请求的上限，或者分辨率参数无效（例如 ``model_name`` 包含 ``@``）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:989
msgid ""
"``422``: neither or both forms supplied, ``model_name`` missing with "
"``token_ids``, or a key is malformed (e.g. ``chunk_hash_hex`` is not "
"hex)."
msgstr "``422``: 提供了不完整或重复的形式，缺少 ``model_name`` 和 ``token_ids``，或者某个键格式错误（例如 ``chunk_hash_hex`` 不是十六进制）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:992
msgid "**Examples:**"
msgstr "**示例：**"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1007
msgid "Cache control"
msgstr "缓存控制"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1009
msgid ""
"The ``/cache`` group dispatches cache operations to a named MP server. It"
" covers **warm prefetch**, **pin/unpin**, and **delete**; further cache-"
"control operations will be documented as endpoints here as they land."
msgstr ""
"``/cache`` 组将缓存操作分派到命名的 MP 服务器。它涵盖 **热预取**、**固定/解固定** 和 "
"**删除**；进一步的缓存控制操作将在此处作为端点记录。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1013
msgid ""
"**Warm prefetch (pre-loading L1 from L2).** Pre-warm one MP server's L1 "
"with the KV for a known prompt **before** the requests arrive, so the "
"first request hits L1 instead of paying the L2 fetch inline -- useful "
"when you know a workload is about to be routed to a node (a traffic "
"shift, a hot shared system prompt)."
msgstr ""
"**热预取（从 L2 预加载 L1）。** 在请求到达之前，用已知提示的 KV 预热一个 MP 服务器的 L1，以便第一个请求命中 "
"L1，而不是支付 L2 内联获取的费用——当您知道工作负载即将路由到节点（流量转移、热共享系统提示）时，这非常有用。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1018
msgid ""
"You describe the content by **token ids** -- the unit the cache speaks --"
" never by internal cache keys, which you cannot construct (a key is a "
"content hash plus a per-rank layout bitmap). The coordinator forwards the"
" request to the named server, which hashes the tokens, expands them "
"across the node's ranks, loads the chunks from L2 into L1, and "
"**retains** them so a later lookup hits. The submit returns a "
"``request_id``; poll the status endpoint until ``completed``. The warm "
"acquires no lock -- the poll simply reports progress and clears the "
"server-side job once the load finishes."
msgstr ""
"您通过 **token ids** "
"描述内容——缓存使用的单位——而不是通过内部缓存键，您无法构造这些键（键是内容哈希加上每个排名的布局位图）。协调器将请求转发到指定的服务器，该服务器对令牌进行哈希，将它们扩展到节点的各个排名，从"
" L2 加载块到 L1，并 **保留** 它们，以便后续查找命中。提交返回一个 ``request_id``；轮询状态端点直到 "
"``completed``。预热不需要获取锁——轮询仅报告进度，并在加载完成后清除服务器端作业。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1028
msgid "``POST /cache/prefetches``"
msgstr "``POST /cache/prefetches``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1030
msgid "Submit a warm prefetch of a token sequence on one named server."
msgstr "在一个指定的服务器上提交一个令牌序列的预热预取。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1043
msgid "Target MP server; must be registered."
msgstr "目标 MP 服务器；必须已注册。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1044 ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1182
#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1274 ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1511
msgid "``model_name``"
msgstr "``model_name``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1046
msgid "Model whose layout sizes the target's L1 buffers."
msgstr "目标的 L1 缓冲区布局大小的模型。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1047 ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1185
#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1514
msgid "``world_size``"
msgstr "``world_size``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1049
msgid ""
"World size (``>= 1``) selecting the KV layout and the per-rank fan-out "
"(``1`` for a single-GPU, TP=1 deployment)."
msgstr "世界大小（``>= 1``），选择 KV 布局和每个 rank 的扇出（对于单 GPU，TP=1 部署为 ``1``）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1051 ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1188
msgid "``token_ids``"
msgstr "``token_ids``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1052 ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1189
msgid "list[int]"
msgstr "列表[int]"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1053
msgid ""
"Prompt tokens whose complete ``chunk_size`` chunks are warmed; must match"
" what was stored (same tokenizer / special tokens). A sub-chunk sequence "
"is a ``noop``."
msgstr "完全 ``chunk_size`` 块的提示令牌已预热；必须与存储的内容匹配（相同的分词器/特殊令牌）。子块序列是 ``noop``。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1056 ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1192
#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1271 ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1518
msgid "``cache_salt``"
msgstr "``cache_salt``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1058
msgid ""
"Optional (default ``\"\"``). Per-tenant isolation salt applied to the "
"produced keys."
msgstr "可选（默认 ``\"\"``）。应用于生成键的每个租户隔离盐。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1067
msgid ""
"When the sequence is shorter than one chunk, nothing is submitted and "
"``request_id`` is empty:"
msgstr "当序列短于一个块时，什么都不会被提交，``request_id`` 为空："

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1074
msgid ""
"``request_id`` is the id to poll; ``chunks`` is the number of whole "
"chunks submitted to warm."
msgstr "``request_id`` 是用于轮询的 ID；``chunks`` 是提交的完整块的数量。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1079
msgid "``200``: submitted (or a ``noop`` as above)."
msgstr "``200``：已提交（或如上所述的 ``noop``）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1080
msgid "``404``: unknown ``instance_id`` (not registered)."
msgstr "``404``: 未知 ``instance_id``（未注册）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1081
msgid "``502``: the target server was unreachable or rejected the submit."
msgstr "``502``: 目标服务器无法访问或拒绝了提交。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1086
msgid ""
"**Single-node scope:** one ``instance_id`` warms only that node's shards."
" For a model sharded across multiple nodes, submit one request per node's"
" instance."
msgstr "**单节点范围：** 一个 ``instance_id`` 仅对该节点的分片进行预热。对于跨多个节点的模型，每个节点的实例需提交一个请求。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1105
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``GET /cache/prefetches/{instance_id}/{request_id}``"
msgstr "``GET /cache/prefetches/{instance_id}/{request_id}``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1107
msgid ""
"Poll a submitted warm prefetch; the response relays the owning server's "
"status verbatim with its code."
msgstr "轮询已提交的预热预取；响应将拥有服务器的状态及其代码逐字传递。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1110
msgid "**Path parameters:**"
msgstr "**路径参数：**"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1121
msgid "The server the prefetch was submitted to."
msgstr "提交预取的服务器。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1122
msgid "``request_id``"
msgstr "``request_id``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1124
msgid "The id returned by ``POST /cache/prefetches``."
msgstr "由 ``POST /cache/prefetches`` 返回的 id。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1126
msgid "**Response** (``200 OK``) while the load runs:"
msgstr "**响应** (``200 OK``) 在加载运行时："

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1132
msgid "…and once complete:"
msgstr "…并且一旦完成："

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1138
msgid "``found_keys`` of ``total_keys`` requested chunks were resident."
msgstr "``found_keys`` 的 ``total_keys`` 请求块是常驻的。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1142
msgid "``200``: status reported (``pending`` or ``completed``)."
msgstr "``200``: 状态报告（``pending`` 或 ``completed``）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1143
msgid ""
"``404``: unknown ``instance_id``, or unknown ``request_id`` relayed from "
"the server."
msgstr "``404``: 未知的 ``instance_id``，或来自服务器的未知 ``request_id``。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1145
msgid "``502``: the target server was unreachable."
msgstr "``502``: 目标服务器无法访问。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1154
msgid ""
"**Pin/unpin (protecting cache from eviction).** Pin a token sequence's "
"cache so it is not evicted from L2 until unpinned. The coordinator "
"resolves the token sequence to its object keys **locally** (no MP-server "
"round-trip) and records them in its L2 eviction plan (``POST``) or "
"releases them (``DELETE``), excluding pinned keys from quota-based "
"eviction. L2 pins are fleet-wide (per ``cache_salt``), so no target "
"instance is named."
msgstr ""
"**固定/解固定（保护缓存不被逐出）。** 固定一个令牌序列的缓存，以便在解固定之前不会从 L2 中被逐出。协调器将令牌序列解析为其对象键 "
"**本地**（无需 MP 服务器往返），并将其记录在 L2 "
"逐出计划中（``POST``）或释放它们（``DELETE``），将固定的键排除在基于配额的逐出之外。L2 固定是全舰队范围的（按 "
"``cache_salt``），因此没有指定目标实例。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1161
msgid ""
"Local resolution requires the coordinator's ``chunk_size`` and "
"``hash_algorithm`` (see `Configuration`_) to match the MP servers' "
"``--chunk-size`` / ``--hash-algorithm``; otherwise the resolved keys will"
" not match what was stored and the pin protects nothing. It also requires"
" the MP servers to be launched with ``--no-separate-object-groups`` (the "
"coordinator resolves keys in a single object group)."
msgstr ""
"本地解析要求协调器的 ``chunk_size`` 和 ``hash_algorithm``（请参见 `Configuration`_）与 MP "
"服务器的 ``--chunk-size`` / ``--hash-algorithm`` "
"匹配；否则解析的键将与存储的键不匹配，且固定不会保护任何内容。它还要求 MP 服务器以 ``--no-separate-object-"
"groups`` 启动（协调器在单个对象组中解析键）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1169
msgid "``POST /cache/pins``"
msgstr "``POST /cache/pins``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1171
msgid "Pin a token sequence's keys in the L2 eviction plan."
msgstr "在 L2 逐出计划中固定一个令牌序列的键。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1184
msgid "Model whose rank fan-out to use when resolving keys."
msgstr "用于解析键时使用的模型的扇出等级。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1187
msgid "World size (``>= 1``) selecting the per-rank fan-out."
msgstr "世界大小（``>= 1``），选择每个排名的扇出。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1190
msgid ""
"Prompt tokens whose complete chunks are pinned; must match what was "
"stored. A sub-chunk sequence pins nothing (``affected`` 0)."
msgstr "完整块被固定的提示令牌；必须与存储的内容匹配。子块序列不固定任何内容（``affected`` 0）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1194
msgid "Optional (default ``\"\"``). Per-tenant isolation salt."
msgstr "可选（默认 ``\"\"``）。每个租户的隔离盐。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1202
msgid ""
"``requested`` is the number of whole chunks resolved; ``affected`` is the"
" number of L2 keys pinned (chunks times the per-rank fan-out)."
msgstr "``requested`` 是解析的完整块数；``affected`` 是固定的 L2 键的数量（块数乘以每个排名的分支因子）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1207
msgid "``200``: pinned."
msgstr "``200``: 已固定。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1208
msgid ""
"``400``: ``token_ids`` exceeds the per-request cap, or ``cache_salt`` "
"violates its invariants."
msgstr "``400``: ``token_ids`` 超过每个请求的上限，或者 ``cache_salt`` 违反了其不变性。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1228
msgid ""
"**Requires event reporting.** The coordinator can only exclude keys from "
"eviction for a salt it is tracking, which requires the MP servers started"
" with ``--coordinator-event-reporting`` (see `Connecting MP servers`_)."
msgstr "**需要事件报告。** 协调器只能排除其正在跟踪的盐的键的逐出，这需要使用 ``--coordinator-event-reporting`` 启动的 MP 服务器（请参见 `连接 MP 服务器`_）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1233
msgid "``DELETE /cache/pins``"
msgstr "``DELETE /cache/pins``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1235
msgid ""
"Unpin a token sequence's keys from the L2 eviction plan. Same request "
"body as ``POST /cache/pins``. The response mirrors the pin (``affected`` "
"is the number of keys unpinned), with ``status`` ``\"unpinned\"``. Pins "
"are reference-counted: a chunk pinned *N* times needs *N* unpins before "
"it can be evicted."
msgstr ""
"从 L2 逐出计划中取消一个令牌序列的键。请求体与 ``POST /cache/pins`` 相同。响应与 pin 相似（``affected``"
" 是取消固定的键的数量），``status`` 为 ``\"unpinned\"``。Pins 是按引用计数的：一个块被固定 *N* 次需要 "
"*N* 次取消固定才能被逐出。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1240
msgid "**HTTP status codes:** same as ``POST /cache/pins``."
msgstr "**HTTP 状态码:** 与 ``POST /cache/pins`` 相同。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1257
msgid "``GET /cache/pins``"
msgstr "``GET /cache/pins``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1259
msgid "List the keys currently pinned in the L2 eviction plan."
msgstr "列出当前在 L2 逐出计划中固定的键。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1261
msgid "**Query parameters** (all optional):"
msgstr "**查询参数**（均为可选）："

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1273
msgid "Only keys with this salt. Default: all salts."
msgstr "仅限具有此盐的键。默认：所有盐。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1276
msgid "Only keys for this model. Default: all models."
msgstr "仅适用于此模型的键。默认：所有模型。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1279
msgid "Matching keys to skip (``>= 0``). Default ``0``."
msgstr "匹配要跳过的键（``>= 0``）。默认值 ``0``。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1282
msgid "Maximum keys to return (``1``-``10000``). Default ``1000``."
msgstr "返回的最大键数（``1``-``10000``）。默认值为``1000``。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1304
msgid ""
"``total`` is the number of pinned keys matching the filters; ``pins`` is "
"the requested page in first-pinned order, each with its current "
"``pin_count``."
msgstr "``total`` 是匹配过滤器的固定键的数量；``pins`` 是按首次固定顺序请求的页面，每个页面都有其当前的 ``pin_count``。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1309
msgid "``200``: listed."
msgstr "``200``: 已列出。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1310
msgid "``422``: ``offset`` or ``limit`` out of range."
msgstr "``422``: ``offset`` 或 ``limit`` 超出范围。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1319
msgid "``POST /cache/delete``"
msgstr "``POST /cache/delete``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1321
msgid "Delete a token sequence on one named server."
msgstr "在一个指定的服务器上删除一个令牌序列。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1323
msgid ""
"**Request body:** (``model_name``, ``world_size``, ``token_ids``, "
"``cache_salt``) plus ``tier`` (``l1`` / ``l2`` / ``all``) and ``force`` "
"(bool, default ``false``). When ``force`` is ``true``, locked keys are "
"deleted anyway (L1 read/write locks on the node and the coordinator's L2 "
"pin set)."
msgstr ""
"**请求体：** (``model_name``, ``world_size``, ``token_ids``, ``cache_salt``) "
"以及 ``tier`` (``l1`` / ``l2`` / ``all``) 和 ``force`` (布尔值，默认 ``false``)。当 "
"``force`` 为 ``true`` 时，锁定的键仍然会被删除（节点上的 L1 读/写锁和协调器的 L2 固定集）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1335
msgid ""
"``requested`` is the number of whole chunks resolved. ``affected`` and "
"``skipped`` are **totals across the tiers acted on**: ``affected`` counts"
" L1 keys removed by the node plus L2 keys removed by the coordinator, and"
" ``skipped`` counts L1 keys the node refused plus L2 keys held back for "
"an L2 pin (non-force only). A chunk resident in both tiers (``tier=all``)"
" contributes to both counts, so ``affected`` may be up to ``2 x requested"
" x world_size``. A sub-chunk sequence returns ``status`` ``\"noop\"``."
msgstr ""
"``requested`` 是已解析的完整块的数量。 ``affected`` 和 ``skipped`` 是 **作用于的各层的总计**： "
"``affected`` 计算节点移除的 L1 键加上协调器移除的 L2 键，而 ``skipped`` 计算节点拒绝的 L1 键加上因 L2 "
"钉住而保留的 L2 键（仅限非强制）。同时存在于两个层中的块（``tier=all``）会对两个计数都有贡献，因此 ``affected`` "
"可能高达 ``2 x requested x world_size``。一个子块序列返回 ``status`` ``\"noop\"``。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1345
msgid "``200``: deleted (or a ``noop``)."
msgstr "``200``: 已删除（或为 ``noop``）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1346
msgid "``404``: no server is registered under ``instance_id``."
msgstr "``404``：没有服务器在 ``instance_id`` 下注册。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1347
msgid "``502``: the target server was unreachable or rejected the delete."
msgstr "``502``: 目标服务器无法访问或拒绝了删除请求。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1367
msgid "Fleet memory"
msgstr "舰队内存"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1369
msgid ""
"The ``/instances/usage`` endpoints report how full each MP server's "
"memory compartments are. A **compartment** is one thing that owns bytes: "
"the L1 pool of a backing medium, or one L2 adapter. It is identified by "
"``(tier, backend)`` -- the same pair cache events tag placements with."
msgstr "``/instances/usage`` 端点报告每个 MP 服务器的内存区间的使用情况。**区间**是拥有字节的一个实体：后端介质的 L1 池，或一个 L2 适配器。它通过 ``(tier, backend)`` 进行标识——与缓存事件标签放置的相同对。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1374
msgid ""
"Two inputs are joined, and both ride the cache-event stream. **Usage** is"
" derived from the events the servers already publish. **Capacity** "
"arrives as a capacity report on the same stream -- once at startup, then "
"whenever an adapter is added, removed, or reconfigured. Both are "
"automatic; there is nothing to configure beyond pointing servers at a "
"coordinator and leaving event reporting enabled."
msgstr "两个输入被连接在一起，并且都通过缓存事件流进行传输。**使用量**来源于服务器已经发布的事件。**容量**作为同一流上的容量报告到达——在启动时一次，然后每当添加、移除或重新配置适配器时都会到达。这两者都是自动的；除了将服务器指向协调器并保持事件报告启用之外，没有其他配置。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1383
msgid ""
"Capacity travels on the event stream, so disabling event reporting "
"disables both halves together: every ``usage_ratio`` reads ``null`` "
"(*unknown*) rather than a ratio against a stale declaration."
msgstr "容量通过事件流传输，因此禁用事件报告会同时禁用两个部分：每个 ``usage_ratio`` 读取 ``null`` (*未知*) 而不是与过时声明的比率。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1387
msgid ""
"These endpoints are read-only. The coordinator never evicts or throttles "
"based on them."
msgstr "这些端点是只读的。协调器从不基于它们逐出或限制。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1392
msgid ""
"``usage_ratio`` is ``null`` whenever the server declared no capacity for "
"a compartment, and this is common: the ``fs``, ``mooncake``, ``p2p``, and"
" ``sagemaker`` adapters expose no capacity setting at all, and ``s3`` / "
"``raw_block`` report one only when you set ``max_capacity_gb`` / "
"``capacity_bytes``. A ``null`` means *unknown*, never *empty* -- do not "
"treat it as ``0``."
msgstr "``usage_ratio`` 在服务器声明某个隔间没有容量时为 ``null``，这种情况很常见：``fs``、``mooncake``、``p2p`` 和 ``sagemaker`` 适配器根本不暴露任何容量设置，而 ``s3`` / ``raw_block`` 仅在您设置 ``max_capacity_gb`` / ``capacity_bytes`` 时报告一个容量。``null`` 表示 *未知*，而不是 *空* -- 不要将其视为 ``0``。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1399
msgid ""
"Ratios above ``1.0`` are reported as-is rather than capped. A compartment"
" holding more than its declared capacity means the declaration is wrong, "
"and that is worth seeing."
msgstr "超过 ``1.0`` 的比率将原样报告，而不是被限制。一个持有超过其声明容量的隔间意味着声明是错误的，这一点值得关注。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1404
msgid "``GET /instances/usage``"
msgstr "``GET /instances/usage``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1406
msgid "The whole fleet: every server's compartments, plus the shared pools."
msgstr "整个集群：每台服务器的隔间，以及共享池。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1435
msgid ""
"``shared_modules`` holds storage several servers mount -- one S3 bucket, "
"one CXL region. These are counted **once for the fleet** and appear in no"
" instance's ``modules``. Summing them per mounting server would multiply "
"both the bytes and the capacity by the number of mounts."
msgstr "``shared_modules`` 保存多个服务器挂载的存储 -- 一个 S3 存储桶，一个 CXL 区域。这些只计算 **一次用于整个集群**，并且不会出现在任何实例的 ``modules`` 中。按挂载服务器进行求和会将字节和容量乘以挂载次数。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1440
msgid ""
"A server appears when it is registered, when it still holds bytes, or "
"when it declared capacity. ``registered: false`` therefore means a "
"departed server whose L2 data outlived it; its L1 bytes are dropped when "
"it goes."
msgstr "服务器在注册时出现，当它仍然持有字节或声明容量时出现。因此，``registered: false`` 表示一个已离开的服务器，其 L2 数据超出了它的生命周期；当它离开时，其 L1 字节会被丢弃。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1457
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``GET /instances/{instance_id}/usage``"
msgstr "``GET /instances/{instance_id}/usage``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1459
msgid ""
"One server's compartments, in the same shape as an entry of ``instances``"
" above."
msgstr "一个服务器的隔间，形状与上面的 ``instances`` 条目相同。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1464
msgid "``200``: found."
msgstr "``200``: 找到了。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1465
msgid ""
"``404``: the coordinator knows nothing about this id -- it is not "
"registered, holds no bytes, and declared no capacity."
msgstr "``404``: 协调器对这个 ID 一无所知——它未注册、没有任何字节，并且未声明任何容量。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1474
#, python-format
msgid ""
"A server whose L1 pool uses the default lazy allocator grows its heap on "
"demand. Capacity here is the **configured** size, not the grown heap, so "
"a freshly started server correctly reads near ``0``\\% rather than near "
"full."
msgstr "使用默认延迟分配器的 L1 池的服务器按需增长其堆。在这里，容量是**配置**的大小，而不是增长后的堆，因此刚启动的服务器正确地读取接近 ``0``\\\\% 而不是接近满。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1479
msgid "CacheBlend fragment lookup"
msgstr "CacheBlend 块查找"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1481
msgid ""
"``POST /directory/blend-lookup`` is the fragment counterpart to "
"``/directory/lookup``: the query need not be a prefix, and each match "
"reports where the content sits in the query and where it sat when stored,"
" so the caller can re-RoPE it."
msgstr "``POST /directory/blend-lookup`` 是 ``/directory/lookup`` 的片段对应：查询不必是前缀，每个匹配报告内容在查询中的位置以及存储时的位置，以便调用者可以重新进行 RoPE。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1486
msgid ""
"It is served from the blend index, derived from the key directory's token"
" bindings — the coordinator learns content from the cache-event stream, "
"not from a separate publish call. Both feeds default to off and both are "
"required: the coordinator needs ``--enable-blend-lookup``, and every MP "
"server whose chunks should be discoverable needs ``--coordinator-event-"
"reporting`` (a server with a coordinator URL but no event reporting warns"
" at startup and matches locally only). Matching is chunked at the "
"coordinator's ``--chunk-size`` — which must equal the MP servers' "
"``--chunk-size`` — probing every ``--blend-probe-stride`` positions."
msgstr "它是从混合索引提供的，该索引源自密钥目录的令牌绑定——协调器从缓存事件流中学习内容，而不是从单独的发布调用中获取。两个数据源默认关闭，且都是必需的：协调器需要 ``--enable-blend-lookup``，而每个其块应可发现的 MP 服务器需要 ``--coordinator-event-reporting``（具有协调器 URL 但没有事件报告的服务器在启动时会发出警告，并且仅在本地匹配）。匹配在协调器的 ``--chunk-size`` 处进行分块——这必须等于 MP 服务器的 ``--chunk-size``——探测每个 ``--blend-probe-stride`` 位置。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1496
msgid ""
"**Request body** — the query tokens plus the caller's identity, which "
"names the namespace matches are scoped to. ``model_name`` is not "
"optional: without it there is no namespace to scope to."
msgstr "**请求体** — 查询令牌加上调用者的身份，指定命名空间匹配的范围。 ``model_name`` 不是可选的：没有它就没有命名空间可供范围限定。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1507
msgid "``tokens_b64``"
msgstr "``tokens_b64``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1509
msgid ""
"Query tokens packed as base64 little-endian ``uint32`` (see "
"``encode_tokens`` / ``decode_tokens`` in ``schemas.py``). Required."
msgstr "以 base64 小端格式打包的查询 token ``uint32``（请参见 ``encode_tokens`` / ``decode_tokens`` 在 ``schemas.py`` 中）。必需。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1513
msgid "Model the caller retrieves under. Required."
msgstr "调用者检索的模型。必填。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1516
msgid ""
"The caller's world size (TP x PP), selecting its rank fan-out. Defaults "
"to ``1``."
msgstr "调用者的世界大小（TP x PP），选择其排名扩展。默认为 ``1``。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1520
msgid "The caller's per-tenant isolation salt. Defaults to ``\"\"``."
msgstr "调用者的每个租户隔离盐。默认为 ``\"\"``。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1522
msgid ""
"``model_name`` / ``world_size`` / ``cache_salt`` are the same three "
"fields ``/directory/lookup``'s tokens form carries, but serve a different"
" purpose here: prefix lookup uses them to *build* the keys it resolves, "
"while a fragment match already names a stored chunk hash and uses them to"
" stay in the namespace the caller can retrieve from. The token encodings "
"differ between the two endpoints for now."
msgstr "``model_name`` / ``world_size`` / ``cache_salt`` 是 ``/directory/lookup`` 的三个字段的令牌形式，但在这里有不同的用途：前缀查找使用它们来 *构建* 解析的键，而片段匹配已经命名了一个存储的块哈希，并使用它们保持在调用者可以检索的命名空间中。目前这两个端点之间的令牌编码不同。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1540
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``chunk_hash`` is the chunk's content hash, which the caller expands to "
"per-rank object keys with its own model, salt, and world size; ``old_st``"
" is its position in the stored sequence (re-RoPE source) and ``cur_st`` "
"its position in the query (re-RoPE target). Matches are sorted ascending "
"by ``cur_st``, at most one per chunk, and may overlap — a caller that "
"scatters them resolves overlaps itself. A query shorter than one chunk, "
"or a coordinator without ``--enable-blend-lookup``, returns "
"``{\"matches\": []}``."
msgstr "``chunk_hash`` 是块的内容哈希，调用者使用自己的模型、盐值和世界大小将其扩展为每个排名的对象键；``old_st`` 是其在存储序列中的位置（re-RoPE 源），而 ``cur_st`` 是其在查询中的位置（re-RoPE 目标）。匹配项按 ``cur_st`` 升序排序，每个块最多一个，并且可能重叠——散布它们的调用者自行解决重叠。短于一个块的查询，或者没有 ``--enable-blend-lookup`` 的协调器，将返回 ``{\"matches\": []}``。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1548
msgid ""
"Only chunks some instance stored under the request's ``model_name`` / "
"``cache_salt`` / ``world_size`` are returned. A chunk hash names content "
"and prefix only, so an unscoped match could name KV under another model "
"or tenant, which the caller's own key expansion could never retrieve. "
"Content held solely by another namespace therefore returns no match "
"rather than one that misses at prefetch."
msgstr "仅返回请求的 ``model_name`` / ``cache_salt`` / ``world_size`` 下存储的块。块哈希仅命名内容和前缀，因此未限定的匹配可能会命名另一个模型或租户下的 KV，而调用者自己的键扩展无法检索。因此，仅由另一个命名空间持有的内容返回时不会有匹配，而不是在预取时未命中的匹配。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1557
msgid "``200``: lookup completed (an empty match list is not an error)."
msgstr "``200``: 查找完成（空匹配列表不是错误）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1558
msgid ""
"``422``: ``tokens_b64`` is not valid base64 or not a whole number of "
"``uint32`` tokens, or it is supplied without ``model_name``."
msgstr "``422``: ``tokens_b64`` 不是有效的 base64 编码，或者不是完整的 ``uint32`` 令牌数量，或者在没有 ``model_name`` 的情况下提供。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:1561
msgid ""
"Index counts are reported under the ``blend`` key of ``GET "
"/directory/stats``."
msgstr "索引计数在 ``GET /directory/stats`` 的 ``blend`` 键下报告。"

